# Provenance and attribution

Upstream: https://github.com/chaitin/agent-compose (AGPL-3.0)

- The `common/proto/agentcompose/v2` bindings are generated from the
  agentcompose v2 protocol schema (option go_package rewritten to this
  module's path).
- The node clients (execution / management binaries) are built against that
  schema; original code from agent-compose's node client, modified for this
  project's split topology.
- `runtime/` carries the vendored agent-compose JS runtime (agent-compose-runtime-sdk)
  that build.sh packages into the node release archives.

Corresponding source is this repository.
